<title>USA: Dallas, Texas, $62 mln deal won by JP Morgan.</title>
<headline>Dallas, Texas, $62 mln deal won by JP Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc said Wednesday it won Dallas, Texas's $62 million water and sewer bond issue at a net interest cost of 5.51 percent.</p>
</text>
